WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hey, are you coming with us tonight?

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.500
I'd love to, but I have to finish this report first.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Come on, you can get it done tomorrow morning.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Fine. Give me twenty minutes and I'll catch up with you.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Deal. Don't let us down this time!
